// No tape. The tracer is a bare substrate test: nothing should happen to it
// except time passing, so that anything which does happen is the engine's doing
// and not an event's.
//
// A recurring currency transfer was tried here first and removed. See the
// dividend recipe's comment in game_data.ron: a paired
// RemoveFromInventory / AddToInventory is not atomic, and mints currency
// whenever the source inventory is short.
(
    recurring: [],
)
